    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32659" root="غول" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَائِلٌ</span></b>  [act. part. n. of 1]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَائِلَةُ النِّطَآءِ</span> <i>A land that destroys its inhabitant by
reason of its far extent.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَائِلَةٌ</span> [as
an epithet applied to a fem. n.] signifies <i>Caused
to become absent,</i> or <i>to disappear; hidden,</i> or <i>concealed:</i> or <i>stolen.</i> (ISh, TA.)

